117760   
117760   % ENTRY: D=NUMBER OF PAGES TO TRANSFER
117760   %        X=CORMAP ELEMENT OF FIRST PAGE TO TRANSFER
117760   %        A=READ/WRITE FLAG
117760   %        B=SEGMENT ADDRESS
